---
const {overview=false}=Astro.props;
const ranges=[['树数量／提升轮数','20—150，间隔 10','20—100，间隔 10','树的数量或提升轮数'],['最大深度','5—25','5—20','树最多划分多少层'],['最大分箱数','16—48','16—48','连续字段最多分成多少个区间'],['子节点最少样本数','2—50','2—50','划分后每个子节点至少保留的记录数'],['训练采样比例','0.5—1.0','0.5—1.0','每棵树或每轮训练使用的采样比例']];
const fixed=[['每个模型的树数量','50 棵','借出、还入模型各有 50 棵树'],['最大深度','10','限制一棵树的划分深度'],['最大分箱数','24','限制连续字段的分箱数量'],['子节点最少样本数','10 条','每个子节点至少保留 10 条记录'],['训练采样比例','80%','与训练／验证／测试分组的比例不同']];
---
{overview ? <div class="training-overview">
 <div class="training-attempt"><span>先尝试</span><strong>Hyperopt 自动调参</strong><p>尝试多组参数，比较验证集误差</p><small>完成部分搜索，后续因内存不足中断</small></div>
 <span class="training-next" aria-hidden="true">↓</span>
 <div class="training-attempt completed"><span>最终使用</span><strong>预设参数训练</strong><p>固定参数，分别训练借出与还入模型</p><small>完成训练、评价并保存模型</small></div>
</div> : <div class="training-methods">
 <nav class="training-local-nav" aria-label="训练方法目录"><a href="#cb-search">查看自动调参 ↓</a><a href="#cb-fixed">查看最终训练 ↓</a><a href="#cb-scores">查看模型成绩 ↓</a></nav>
 <section id="cb-search" class="training-path">
  <h4>先尝试自动搜索参数</h4><p class="path-intro">Hyperopt 在代码设定的范围内尝试参数；每次用训练集训练，用验证集评价。</p>
  <ol class="training-steps">
   <li><div class="step-title"><span>1</span><h5>抽样并留出验证数据</h5></div><div class="step-body"><div class="training-node">Silver → 抽取约 50 万条记录</div><div class="training-split search-split"><div><b>80% 训练集</b><span>用于训练模型</span></div><div><b>20% 验证集</b><span>用于比较参数</span></div></div><p class="training-note">按比例抽样，实际行数会浮动。保存的早期搜索记录使用 11 个时间字段。</p></div></li>
   <li><div class="step-title"><span>2</span><h5>设置允许搜索的参数范围</h5></div><div class="step-body"><div class="training-table"><table><caption>Hyperopt 从这些范围中选择参数</caption><thead><tr><th>参数</th><th>随机森林</th><th>梯度提升树</th><th>控制什么？</th></tr></thead><tbody>{ranges.map(row=><tr>{row.map((cell,i)=>i===0?<th scope="row">{cell}</th>:<td>{cell}</td>)}</tr>)}</tbody></table></div><p class="training-note">深度、分箱数和样本数取整数。“间隔 10”表示树数量可以取 20、30、40……，这些范围由代码预先设置。</p></div></li>
   <li><div class="step-title"><span>3</span><h5>反复训练，比较验证集误差</h5></div><div class="step-body"><div class="search-loop"><div><strong>提出一组参数</strong><span>例如 90 棵树、最大深度 14</span></div><i>↓</i><div><strong>使用训练集训练</strong><span>借出和还入是独立的搜索任务</span></div><i>↓</i><div><strong>预测验证集</strong><span>计算 RMSE，并记录 R²</span></div><i>↓</i><div><strong>记录参数和误差</strong><span>以验证集 RMSE 最小为目标</span></div><span class="loop-return">↶ 继续尝试下一组参数</span></div><p class="training-note">RMSE 是预测数量与实际数量的误差指标，越小越好；具体计算过程见下方“怎样评价模型”。</p></div></li>
   <li><div class="step-title"><span>4</span><h5>保存已完成的搜索结果</h5></div><div class="step-body"><div class="training-table"><table><caption>四类任务留下了三份完整搜索结果</caption><thead><tr><th>模型</th><th>预测借出量</th><th>预测还入量</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">随机森林</th><td>8 次试验</td><td>8 次试验</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">梯度提升树</th><td>8 次试验</td><td>没有训练结果</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
    <details class="training-more"><summary>查看已保存的最佳参数</summary><div class="training-table"><table><thead><tr><th>搜索任务</th><th>树数量／轮数</th><th>深度</th><th>分箱数</th><th>最少样本数</th><th>采样比例</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">随机森林 · 借出</th><td>90</td><td>14</td><td>29</td><td>23</td><td>约 50.93%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">随机森林 · 还入</th><td>80</td><td>13</td><td>30</td><td>38</td><td>约 50.64%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">梯度提升树 · 借出</th><td>90</td><td>6</td><td>26</td><td>14</td><td>约 74.31%</td></tr></tbody></table></div></details>
    <p class="training-note">后续尝试因内存不足中断。最终训练使用了预设参数。</p>
   </div></li>
  </ol>
 </section>
 <div class="training-change"><span aria-hidden="true">↓</span><p>改用预设参数，完成最终训练</p></div>
 <section id="cb-fixed" class="training-path">
  <h4>使用预设参数训练两个模型</h4><p class="path-intro">读取 Silver 的 19 个输入字段，分别学习同一小时的借出量与还入量。</p>
  <ol class="training-steps">
   <li><div class="step-title"><span>1</span><h5>将完整数据随机分成三组</h5></div><div class="step-body"><div class="training-node">约 438.8 万条 Silver 站点小时记录</div><div class="training-split final-split"><div><b>80% 训练集</b><span>约 351 万条</span></div><div><b>10% 验证集</b><span>约 44 万条</span></div><div><b>10% 测试集</b><span>约 44 万条</span></div></div><div class="training-table"><table><thead><tr><th>集合</th><th>用途</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">训练集</th><td>学习字段与借还量之间的关系。</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">验证集</th><td>检查预测表现，供方案比较。</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">测试集</th><td>独立评价最终模型。</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class="training-note">按整行随机分配：输入字段与实际借还量一起进入同一组。随机种子固定为 42，实际行数略有浮动。</p></div></li>
   <li><div class="step-title"><span>2</span><h5>用同一组预设参数，分别训练借出与还入模型</h5></div><div class="step-body"><div class="training-table"><table><caption>最终随机森林使用的参数</caption><thead><tr><th>参数</th><th>实际设置</th><th>含义</th></tr></thead><tbody>{fixed.map(row=><tr>{row.map((cell,i)=>i===0?<th scope="row">{cell}</th>:<td>{cell}</td>)}</tr>)}</tbody></table></div><div class="model-pair"><div><strong>借出模型</strong><span>19 个输入字段 → 借出量</span><small>50 棵回归树</small></div><div><strong>还入模型</strong><span>19 个输入字段 → 还入量</span><small>50 棵回归树</small></div></div>
    <details class="training-more"><summary>每棵树怎样学习？</summary><p>回归树是预测数值的决策树。程序在训练记录中尝试字段和切分位置，选择能够减少分组内借还量差异的划分；最后用末端分组的平均数量给出预测。</p><div class="tree-example"><strong>假设示例：是否处于高峰时段？</strong><div><span>否 → 再根据其他字段划分</span><span>是 → 再根据其他字段划分</span></div><p>每棵树给出数量预测 → 随机森林取平均</p></div><p>每棵树可以使用多个字段，没有固定的“时间树”或“天气树”。字段候选具有随机性，具体分支根据训练数据选择；图示不代表保存模型的真实分支。</p></details>
   </div></li>
   <li id="cb-scores"><div class="step-title"><span>3</span><h5>计算预测误差，保存模型和结果</h5></div><div class="step-body"><div class="training-node">验证集和测试集 → 分别预测 → 分别计算 RMSE、R²</div><div class="training-table"><table><caption>原版随机森林的评价结果</caption><thead><tr><th>模型</th><th>验证 RMSE</th><th>验证 R²</th><th>测试 RMSE</th><th>测试 R²</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">借出模型</th><td>3.043</td><td>0.641</td><td>3.038</td><td>0.644</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">还入模型</th><td>3.844</td><td>0.436</td><td>3.848</td><td>0.436</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
    <details class="training-more"><summary>RMSE 和 R² 怎样评价模型？</summary><div class="error-flow"><span>每条记录的预测值 − 实际值</span><i>↓</i><span>将每个差值平方</span><i>↓</i><span>求平均，再开平方</span><i>↓</i><strong>得到 RMSE，越小表示误差越小</strong></div><p>RMSE 与预测数量使用相同单位，较大的误差受到更重的影响。R² 衡量模型相对“总是预测实际值均值”的改善程度，它不是准确率，也可能为负数。</p></details>
    <p class="training-note">这些成绩对应原版字段和随机切分。<a href="#citibike-review">后续字段与切分修复见阶段七 ↗</a></p>
   </div></li>
  </ol>
 </section>
 <p class="training-boundary">早期搜索记录使用 11 个时间字段，最终训练使用 19 个字段。这是先后进行的两次训练尝试，分数差异不能只归因于参数选择方式。</p>
</div>}
<style>
.training-overview{max-width:650px;margin:0 auto 28px;padding:22px;background:#eef3f3;border-radius:10px;text-align:center}.training-attempt{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:7px}.training-attempt>span{font-size:13px;color:var(--cb-secondary)}.training-attempt strong{font-size:22px;font-weight:650}.training-attempt p{font-size:16px}.training-attempt small{font-size:14px;color:#6e593c}.training-attempt.completed small{color:#315e72}.training-next{display:block;padding:16px;font-size:25px;color:var(--cb-secondary)}.training-methods{padding:10px 0 28px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.85}.training-local-nav{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px 24px;margin:5px 0 30px;font-size:14px}.training-local-nav a{text-underline-offset:5px}.training-path,.training-steps>li{scroll-margin-top:120px}.training-path h4{font-size:24px;margin:0 0 10px}.path-intro{color:var(--cb-secondary)}.training-steps{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:28px 0 0}.training-steps>li{position:relative;padding:0 0 32px 40px;border-left:1px solid var(--cb-line);margin-left:14px}.training-steps>li:last-child{padding-bottom:10px;border-left-color:transparent}.step-title{display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:16px}.step-title>span{position:absolute;left:-15px;top:2px;border:1px solid var(--cb-line);border-radius:50%;background:#f7f8f2;width:29px;height:29px;display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:14px;line-height:1}.step-title h5{font-size:19px;line-height:1.7;margin:0 0 16px;font-weight:650}.step-body{min-width:0}.training-node{padding:16px;background:#eef3f3;text-align:center;border-radius:5px;font-size:16px}.training-split{display:grid;gap:8px;margin:14px 0 20px}.search-split{grid-template-columns:4fr 1fr}.final-split{grid-template-columns:2fr 1fr 1fr}.training-split>div{padding:14px 10px;background:#d9e8ee;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:5px}.training-split>div:nth-child(2){background:#e9eeea}.training-split>div:nth-child(3){background:#f0e9da}.training-split b{font-size:16px}.training-split span{font-size:14px;color:var(--cb-secondary)}.training-table{overflow-x:auto;margin:18px 0}.training-table table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;text-align:left;font-size:14px;line-height:1.8}.training-table th,.training-table td{padding:12px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--cb-line);vertical-align:top}.training-table thead{background:#e7eff0}.training-table th{font-weight:600}.training-table caption{text-align:left;font-size:16px;font-weight:600;padding-bottom:12px}.training-note{font-size:14px;color:var(--cb-secondary);line-height:1.85}.search-loop{position:relative;max-width:540px;margin:8px auto 18px;border-right:1px dashed #9eb5bd;border-radius:0 12px 12px 0;padding:20px 28px 14px;background:#eef3f3;text-align:center}.search-loop>div{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:3px}.search-loop strong{font-size:17px}.search-loop span{font-size:14px;color:var(--cb-secondary)}.search-loop>i{font-style:normal;display:block;font-size:21px;margin:8px}.loop-return{display:block;border-top:1px dashed var(--cb-line);margin-top:18px;padding-top:12px}.training-more{margin:20px 0 6px;border-block:1px solid var(--cb-line);padding:12px 0;font-size:15px;color:var(--cb-secondary)}.training-more summary{cursor:pointer;color:var(--cb-ink);font-size:15px;min-height:30px;line-height:1.8}.training-more p{margin:14px 0!important}.training-change{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:8px;border-block:1px solid var(--cb-line);padding:20px;margin:18px 0 32px;color:#315e72}.training-change>span{font-size:25px}.model-pair{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:22px;margin:22px 0}.model-pair>div{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;border-top:2px solid #8aadb9;padding:16px 0}.model-pair strong{font-size:18px}.model-pair span,.model-pair small{font-size:14px;color:var(--cb-secondary)}.tree-example{padding:20px;background:#eef3f3;text-align:center}.tree-example>div{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:15px;margin:16px 0}.tree-example>div>span{border-top:1px solid var(--cb-line);padding-top:12px}.error-flow{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:9px;background:#eef3f3;padding:20px;margin-top:15px;text-align:center}.error-flow i{font-style:normal}.training-boundary{border-top:1px solid var(--cb-line);padding-top:20px;margin-top:20px!important;font-size:14px;color:var(--cb-secondary)}
@media(max-width:640px){.training-overview{padding:20px 14px}.training-attempt strong{font-size:19px}.training-attempt p{font-size:14px}.training-path h4{font-size:21px}.training-steps>li{padding-left:24px;margin-left:12px}.step-title h5{font-size:17px}.training-table th,.training-table td{padding:9px 7px;font-size:12px}.training-table table{min-width:370px}.training-table{max-width:100%}.search-split{grid-template-columns:1.5fr 1fr}.training-split b{font-size:13px}.training-split span{font-size:12px}.training-split>div{padding:11px 6px}.training-node{font-size:14px;padding:13px 10px}.search-loop{padding:16px 12px}.model-pair{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:8px}.tree-example>div{grid-template-columns:1fr}.training-local-nav{gap:8px 16px}.training-table:after{content:'表格可左右滑动';display:block;font-size:12px;color:var(--cb-secondary);padding-top:8px}.training-note{font-size:13px}}
</style>
